  nodeID: 1
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: MC
  dialogText:
  - You spend another saturday night working in that terrible fast food chain. The
    joint is empty apart from a hobo that is sleeping with his head on a table.
  - 'It was supposed to be a moment of freedom. After school, you''d grab a convinient
    job, you''d take it a little slow, you earn yourself a little breathing room. '
  - A last hurrah of freedom before you get serious and get yourself a real job.
  - 'Now that small time after school that was supposed to be a year has turned into
    three. '
  - ... and every night you are haunted by the feeling that you're making a horrible
    mistake, but you can never tell what it is.
  - ... until she enters.
  character_img: {fileID: 0}
  background_img: {fileID: -7930071906021335900, guid: 267aff00605d08142ba91011f8bd457b, type: 3}
