  nodeID: 3
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: MC
  dialogText:
  - A jolt of electricty runs down your spine. It creates a spark between you and
    the cash register as you type in the order.
  - It runs into your cerebellum and wipes away every trace of the bored daydreaming
    that you have indulged in the last hours.
  - It dissipates but not entirely. Left is a burning cold tension that tingles in
    the back of your neck.
  character_img: {fileID: 0}
