  nodeID: 5
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: MC
  dialogText:
  - You telepathically start transferring all your energy to manifest one thought
    in her brain.
  - Look up.
  - Smile.
  - Ask me how I am.
  - You smell the smell of cigarettes and beer on her - the ubiqutous deodorant of
    those who party. It remebers you of you from not long ago - and you start missing
    it.
  - '"A large fries is plenty."'
  - ...mylady.
