  nodeID: 9
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: MC
  dialogText:
  - '"Thank you for your order. It''ll be a couple of minutes."'
  - You turn around on the spot and start shouting.
  - '"BOB! YOU SLEEPY BASTARD! WAKE UP!'
  - You throw her an apologetic smile. "Sorry, that's just the way we talk around
    here."
  - '"BOB! A MENU 2 WITH LARGE FRIES."'
  - All you hear from Bob is an affirmative grunt from the hellish room that is the
    kitchen. We don't go there, food comes from there.
  character_img: {fileID: 0}
  background_img: {fileID: 0}
  nodeQuestion: 0
